{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexalith</strong> is a strategic sci-fi city-builder where you expand a glowing hex-grid colony by placing resource, city, and bonus tiles. Build your world using a deck-like blueprint system, adapt to changing conditions, and optimize each run for score. Every playthrough offers new combinations, challenges, and paths to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/4d04b027943b8e9905dc2d750eaff24f.avif?t=1768848092\" width=1560 height=411 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place resource tiles to harvest materials used to construct and upgrade cities. Cities generate vital civilization points -\u00a0<strong>Population, Ecology, </strong>and<strong> Technology</strong>, that determine whether your world thrives or collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete main and side missions while reacting to dynamic world effects that can disrupt even the best-planned layouts. Smart positioning, timing, and blueprint choices are key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/579d4b561d2beac05ad6929f8b24b5b4.poster.avif?t=1768848092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/579d4b561d2beac05ad6929f8b24b5b4.webm?t=1768848092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/579d4b561d2beac05ad6929f8b24b5b4.mp4?t=1768848092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/2417840fc7fc0c603e6ba225e326cba0.avif?t=1768848092\" width=1560 height=408 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboard with high-score competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect up to <strong>30 blueprints</strong> and <strong>20 bonus tiles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic world effects that alter game conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game shop to purchase blueprints and powerful actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade cities by merging and combining them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main missions and optional side objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorative bonus tiles for score boosts and visual variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes for different playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/111d98e2ac5397aff496ceaf5869e043.poster.avif?t=1768848092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/111d98e2ac5397aff496ceaf5869e043.webm?t=1768848092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/111d98e2ac5397aff496ceaf5869e043.mp4?t=1768848092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/58d6237ea39857188d32dc2bcc31fef7.avif?t=1768848092\" width=1560 height=411 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong> \u2013 A complete, goal-driven experience where you aim to beat the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinity Mode</strong> \u2013 Continue playing endlessly and compete for the top spot on the global leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Mode</strong> \u2013 A stress-free sandbox where you can build and experiment without failure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/50e086bbf561d7751f805304622129fe.poster.avif?t=1768848092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/50e086bbf561d7751f805304622129fe.webm?t=1768848092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/50e086bbf561d7751f805304622129fe.mp4?t=1768848092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexalith was created by a small group of friends as a passion project, born from a shared love for making games and building open-ended sandbox experiences. It\u2019s meant to be a place to slow down, experiment, and enjoy the simple pleasure of shaping a world. :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683050?t=1768848092","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/eacf832a52feebc8bd94df400d7e2a81194ff02f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768848092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/15765175a1c43b7939e56f0bdc261bdc9dd14fce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768848092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/15765175a1c43b7939e56f0bdc261bdc9dd14fce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768848092","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4078440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexalith</strong> is a strategic sci-fi city-builder where you expand a glowing hex-grid colony by placing resource, city, and bonus tiles. Build your world using a deck-like blueprint system, adapt to changing conditions, and optimize each run for score. Every playthrough offers new combinations, challenges, and paths to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/4d04b027943b8e9905dc2d750eaff24f.avif?t=1768848092\" width=1560 height=411 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place resource tiles to harvest materials used to construct and upgrade cities. Cities generate vital civilization points -\u00a0<strong>Population, Ecology, </strong>and<strong> Technology</strong>, that determine whether your world thrives or collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete main and side missions while reacting to dynamic world effects that can disrupt even the best-planned layouts. Smart positioning, timing, and blueprint choices are key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/579d4b561d2beac05ad6929f8b24b5b4.poster.avif?t=1768848092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/579d4b561d2beac05ad6929f8b24b5b4.webm?t=1768848092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati