ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/58d6237ea39857188d32dc2bcc31fef7.avif?t=1768848092\" width=1560 height=411 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong> \u2013 A complete, goal-driven experience where you aim to beat the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinity Mode</strong> \u2013 Continue playing endlessly and compete for the top spot on the global leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Mode</strong> \u2013 A stress-free sandbox where you can build and experiment without failure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/50e086bbf561d7751f805304622129fe.poster.avif?t=1768848092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/50e086bbf561d7751f805304622129fe.webm?t=1768848092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/50e086bbf561d7751f805304622129fe.mp4?t=1768848092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexalith was created by a small group of friends as a passion project, born from a shared love for making games and building open-ended sandbox experiences. It\u2019s meant to be a place to slow down, experiment, and enjoy the simple pleasure of shaping a world. :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Artemi Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/667582e4061b61e4eb6d1a5a0f8