am/apps/3683050/5a6706366e200a7b5340e92581fbab88c4a19773/ss_5a6706366e200a7b5340e92581fbab88c4a19773.600x338.jpg?t=1768848092"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/a8e463f891220150061912abdf9675a732e79d1b/ss_a8e463f891220150061912abdf9675a732e79d1b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768848092","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/a8e463f891220150061912abdf9675a732e79d1b/ss_a8e463f891220150061912abdf9675a732e79d1b.600x338.jpg?t=1768848092"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/b04c2090c4546c0ee2578a07a7915e57157f72b8/ss_b04c2090c4546c0ee2578a07a7915e57157f72b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768848092","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/b04c2090c4546c0ee2578a07a7915e57157f72b8/ss_b04c2090c4546c0ee2578a07a7915e57157f72b8.600x338.jpg?t=1768848092"}],"short_description":"A hex-grid sci-fi city-builder game focused on planning and experimentation. Place resource and city tiles, balance core civilization stats, adapt to shifting world conditions, and shape each run through blueprint-based progression across multiple game modes.","steam_appid":3683050,"support_info":{"email":"support@artemi-studios.com","url":"https://artemi-studios.com"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese","type":"game","website":"https://artemi-studios.com"}